1
00:00:00,127 --> 00:00:01,427
(Sheldon:)Wait.

2
00:00:01,629 --> 00:00:03,529
(Sheldon:)Here who is where?

3
00:00:05,266 --> 00:00:08,466
(Amy:)Me. Aren't I your perfect roommate?

4
00:00:08,769 --> 00:00:11,599
(Penny:)- Um...
- Think about it, Sheldon.

5
00:00:11,806 --> 00:00:14,466
(Amy:)I'm not a stranger,
we're intellectually compatible...

6
00:00:14,675 --> 00:00:17,945
(Amy:)...I'm willing to chauffeur you around,
and your personality quirks...

7
00:00:18,145 --> 00:00:22,345
(Amy:)...which others find abhorrent
or rage-inducing, I find cute as a button.

8
00:00:23,551 --> 00:00:25,311
(Amy:)What do you think?

9
00:00:30,725 --> 00:00:32,125
(Leonard:)Um...

10
00:00:33,361 --> 00:00:35,921
(Amy:)Tell me one reason
why this isn't a fantastic idea.

11
00:00:36,097 --> 00:00:37,527
(Leonard:)Um...

12
00:00:38,733 --> 00:00:40,793
(Amy:)See? You can't.

13
00:00:41,002 --> 00:00:44,372
(Amy:)I'm gonna go see if Leonard's room
is big enough for my water bed.

14
00:00:47,208 --> 00:00:48,908
(Leonard:)Um...

15
00:00:51,479 --> 00:00:54,109
Good buddy Leonard?
Good buddy Leonard.

